SEL: every file downloaded from a SEL device (FTP, Telnet/serial ``FILE SHOW``, YMODEM, relay web pages, the RTAC ``soe.csv``, SEL-3620 X.509 exports, and saved command outputs) and every file PEAT derives from them (``combined_SET_ALL.txt``, ``extracted_SET_ALL.txt``, RDB streams, decompressed ``.CID`` files) is now hashed and recorded in the device's ``files``, with the hashes added to ``related.hash``.
